OL,3,GNEWSADeal agreed to end health visitor
OL,4,Astrike affecting baby appointments
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth visitors are set to return to
OL,7,Fwork next week after a deal was reached
OL,8,Fto end a nine-month strike that saw
OL,9,Fthousands of missed appointments.
OL,11,FUnite union said the agreement with Cwm
OL,12,FTaf Morgannwg University Health Board
OL,13,Fwould see all health visitors offered
OL,14,Fnew roles, describing it as a "historic
OL,15,Fpay win" and a major victory for
OL,16,Fworkers.
OL,18,FThe health board said it had agreed to
OL,19,Fdevelop a new specialist health visitor
OL,20,Frole with additional responsibilities,
OL,21,Fsubject to approval processes.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
